-Guy Marchand est en tête d'affiche. -D'accord.
-Guy Marchand is lead.
-Okay.

185
00:09:44,720 --> 00:09:48,160
Tu es Dario, le cheminot et second rôle.
You're Dario, the railroad worker
and supporting actor.

186
00:09:48,600 --> 00:09:49,640
-Super ! -Ouais.
-Great!
-Yeah.

187
00:09:50,200 --> 00:09:53,080
C'est un jeune idéaliste engagé politiquement,
He's a young,
politically committed idealist,

188
00:09:53,160 --> 00:09:56,080
pas très à l'aise avec les filles...
not very comfortable with girls...

189
00:09:56,160 --> 00:09:57,520
Alors tu as pensé à moi !
So you thought of me!

190
00:09:57,960 --> 00:09:59,160
Exactement !
Exactly!

191
00:10:00,040 --> 00:10:02,880
Elle a failli se prostituer pour te décrocher l'audition.
She almost became a hooker
to get you the audition.

192
00:10:03,800 --> 00:10:04,720
C'est faux.
Not true.

193
00:10:06,760 --> 00:10:07,840
Eh bien, merci.
Well, thanks.

194
00:10:07,920 --> 00:10:09,480
Je vous raccompagne ?
Shall I see you out?

195
00:10:11,600 --> 00:10:12,920
Ouais.
Yeah.

196
00:10:15,560 --> 00:10:17,000
Au revoir.
Bye.

197
00:10:19,040 --> 00:10:20,240
Comment va ta mère ?
How's your mom?

198
00:10:20,560 --> 00:10:22,920
Le bromazépam est devenu son meilleur ami.
Bromazepam is her new best friend.

199
00:10:23,640 --> 00:10:25,040
Comment il va ?
How's he?

200
00:10:25,160 --> 00:10:27,920
