-He collapsed a couple of weeks ago.
-What!

201
00:10:28,040 --> 00:10:30,680
-Tu n'étais pas au courant ? -Il ne m'a rien dit.
-Didn't you know?
-He didn't tell me.

202
00:10:32,280 --> 00:10:35,360
