He never tells me anything. Why start now?

203
00:10:36,120 --> 00:10:38,200
Passe le voir.
Drop by and see him.

204
00:10:38,960 --> 00:10:39,960
Je ne sais pas.
I don't know.

205
00:10:40,680 --> 00:10:43,160
C'est toujours très gênant.
It's always really uncomfortable.

206
00:10:43,280 --> 00:10:44,280
En tout cas tu es là.
Anyway you're here.

207
00:10:45,120 --> 00:10:46,560
J'ai besoin de prendre un peu de recul.
I need to step back a little.

208
00:10:46,640 --> 00:10:50,280
