Ils font un biopic sur Johnny Hallyday ?
They're doing a Johnny Hallyday biopic?

262
00:13:16,000 --> 00:13:18,320
Attends une seconde.
Hang on a moment.

263
00:13:18,880 --> 00:13:21,120
-Cette Sofia travaille à l'accueil ? -Oui.
-This Sofia works at reception?
-Yes.

264
00:13:21,240 --> 00:13:22,640
-C'est une actrice ? -Oui.
-She's an actress?
-Yes.

265
00:13:22,880 --> 00:13:24,360
-Tu es son agent. -Exact.
-You're her agent.
-Right.

266
00:13:24,440 --> 00:13:27,720
