Same again.

293
00:14:51,000 --> 00:14:52,240
Santé.
Cheers.

294
00:14:53,520 --> 00:14:54,400
Salut.
Hi.

295
00:14:56,560 --> 00:14:59,080
-On prend un verre tout à l'heure ? -Avec plaisir.
-How about a drink later?
-For sure.

296
00:14:59,160 --> 00:15:00,000
Cool.
Cool.

297
