313
00:16:10,160 --> 00:16:12,080
Non, on se ressemble trop.
No, we're too alike.

314
00:16:12,320 --> 00:16:14,440
C'est mon rêve, coucher avec mon double.
It's my dream, to sleep with my double.

315
00:16:16,640 --> 00:16:18,320
