You're walking out on us?

316
00:16:18,400 --> 00:16:20,720
Non, je vais juste aux toilettes.
No, just going to the bathroom.

317
00:16:23,640 --> 00:16:25,760
En fait, Hervé...
Actually, Hervé...

318
