They're childhood friends.

319
00:16:29,480 --> 00:16:30,440
Qui ?
Who?

320
00:16:30,520 --> 00:16:32,400
Camille et Hippolyte.
Camille and Hippolyte.

321
00:16:33,600 --> 00:16:35,160
Elle a grandi à Mandelieu.
She grew up in Mandelieu.

322
00:16:35,240 --> 00:16:37,920
Leurs pères se connaissent bien.
Their fathers know each other well.

323
00:16:38,280 --> 00:16:41,280
T'es défoncée ? T'as encore fouillé dans mon sac !
Are you on drugs?
You've been in my bag again!

324
00:16:42,400 --> 00:16:43,400
Je te jure,
I swear,

325
00:16:43,520 --> 00:16:46,640
J'ai juré de garder le secret mais elle me l'a dit.
I'm sworn to secrecy but she told me.

