de ne jamais répéter ça à qui que ce soit.
never to repeat this to a soul.

331
00:17:04,440 --> 00:17:06,350
-Je jure... -Christophe Lambert !
-I swear...
-Christophe Lambert!

332
00:17:12,800 --> 00:17:14,760
-Sérieux ! -Je jure.
-Seriously!
-I swear.

333
00:17:14,880 --> 00:17:18,830
-Elle lui ressemble. -Tu trouves aussi ?
-She does look like him.
-You think so too?

334
00:17:32,640 --> 00:17:35,880
-Smoothie mangue, quelqu'un ? -Oui !
-Mango smoothie anyone?
-Yeah!

335
