T'es sûre que t'exagères pas ?
Sure you're not overdoing it?

336
00:17:38,920 --> 00:17:41,200
-Salope ! -Des infos sur Luchini ?
-Bitch!
-Anything on Luchini?

337
00:17:41,280 --> 00:17:43,440
Il n'est pas en couple.
He's not in a relationship.

338
00:17:43,520 --> 00:17:46,080
Il vient de s'installer dans un immeuble à Montmartre
He just moved to a block in Montmartre

339
00:17:46,200 --> 00:17:47,920
où Céline a habité.
where Céline once stayed.

340
00:17:48,000 --> 00:17:50,000
Et il est allergique à la noix de coco.
And he's allergic to coconut.

341
00:17:50,080 --> 00:17:52,120
On ne prépare pas un homicide.
We're not planning a homicide.

342
00:17:52,200 --> 00:17:54,960
Il s'entraîne dans une salle dans le 1er arrondissement.
He works out at a gym in the 1st district.

343
00:17:55,040 --> 00:17:56,800
Bien ! Quel jour, à quelle heure ?
Good! What day, what time?

344
00:17:56,880 --> 00:17:57,960
Aucune idée.
No idea.

345
00:17:58,040 --> 00:17:59,560
Alors renseigne-toi... Salope !
Then find out... Bitch!

346
00:18:02,880 --> 00:18:04,920
Tirez, relâchez...
Pull, release...

347
00:18:05,040 --> 00:18:06,760
Tirez, relâchez...
Pull, release...

348
00:18:07,320 --> 00:18:08,840
Tirez, relâchez...
Pull, release...

349
00:18:09,320 --> 00:18:11,800
Tirez, relâchez... C'est un peu mou.
Pull, release... It's bit feeble.

350
00:18:12,280 --> 00:18:15,040
-Trop lourd pour moi. -Je n'ai mis aucun poids !
-Too heavy for me.
-I didn't load any weights!

351
00:18:15,120 --> 00:18:18,320
-Ça doit être cassé. -Transpirez ou ça ne sera pas crédible.
-It must be bust.
-Get a sweat on or it won't look credible.

352
00:18:18,440 --> 00:18:20,640
T'es aussi raide qu'un marteau.
You're as stiff as amarteau.

353
00:18:21,320 --> 00:18:24,000
Tirez, relâchez...
Pull, release...

354
00:18:33,520 --> 00:18:35,520
Maintenant courez, chaque seconde compte ! Allez !
Now jog, every second counts! Go!

355
00:18:42,520 --> 00:18:45,240
-Bonjour, Fabrice ! -Salut.
-Hello, Fabrice!
-Hi.

356
00:18:45,720 --> 00:18:47,760
-Comment tu vas ? -Bien.
-How are you?
-Fine.

357
00:18:49,960 --> 00:18:53,280
J'adore cette salle. Tu viens souvent ?
I just love this gym.
Do you come here often?

358
00:18:53,400 --> 00:18:56,800
Oui, j'y mets beaucoup du mien. En vain !
Yes, I put a lot into it. To no avail!

359
